# Hygiene improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

Own dead-storage cleanup as part of the training curriculum.

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_hygiene/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` (run if missing).
2. Run: `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py hygiene`
   - Auto-deletes safe dead roots (`_legacy*`, `.tmp-*`, `_mcp_deploy`, …)
   - Refuses protected trees (`lib`, `apps`, `packages`, `supabase`, …)
   - Updates `.gitignore` so junk never lands on GitHub
3. Append lessons when a new junk pattern appears.
4. Expand `SAFE_ROOT_PATTERNS` in `scripts/repo_hygiene_improve_harness.py`
   when a new waste class shows up.

## Do not

- Delete `third_party`, `lib`, `apps`, `packages`, live `docs`, or `.tools`
- Commit secrets while cleaning
- Leave nested full-repo mirrors (`_legacy-downloads-copy`, etc.)
